The constraints force three blocks: Ben–Elif–Gus in consecutive slots (Gus is immediately after Elif, and exactly one slot separates Ben from Gus with Ben first), Dev–Ann as a pair (Ann is immediately after Dev), and Ivo–_–Cara (exactly one slot between them, Ivo first). Ben before Dev puts Ben–Elif–Gus entirely before Dev–Ann, and Dev before Ivo puts Ivo after Ann. The only placement that also leaves Finn before Dev and at least three slots from Ann, with Hana after Ann, is Finn in 1 and Hana between Ivo and Cara.

